# `skills.set_var`

Set a KV variable (value_json) on a skill.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.skills.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `key` | `string` | yes |
| `value_json` | `string` | yes |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call skills.set_var --json '{ "id": "", "key": "", "value_json": "" }'
```

